codex
The failure is caused by this audit sandbox’s PID/proc mapping: a process reports a namespace PID for which `/proc/<pid>/exe` does not exist, while `/proc/self/exe` is valid. Lean 4.22 uses `/proc/<getpid()>/exe` to locate itself. I’m applying a narrowly scoped preload shim in `/tmp/audit-work` that makes `getpid()` return the proc-visible self PID only for the clean-build subprocess; it does not alter any mounted input or generated Lean source.
